---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/base-layout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About | PixelBrewer">
  <article class="max-w-2xl">
    <header class="mb-10">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ctp-text">
        About
      </h1>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ctp-subtext0">
      <p>
        I'm Alex Blair, a software engineer exploring console applications and game development.
      </p>

      <p>
        I spend a lot of my time exploring C++, C#, Go, game development, graphics,
        backend systems, developer tooling, and Linux with Omarchy. I especially like
        projects that give me an opportunity to experience computing the way it felt
        when I was a kid: exciting, curious, and new.
      </p>

      <p>
        Outside of programming, I'm an avid strategy gamer. It's one of my favorite
        genres, even if it has become a little niche. I practice kendo, a form of
        Japanese fencing, ski in the winter, brew a good cup of coffee, and spend
        plenty of time with my two cats.
      </p>

      <p>
        PixelBrewer is where I write about what I'm learning, document projects
        I'm working on, and share the things I find interesting along the way.
      </p>

      <p>
        You can find more of my work on{" "}
        <a
          href="https://github.com/PixelBrewer"
          class="font-medium text-ctp-blue underline decoration-ctp-surface1 underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-ctp-sapphire hover:decoration-ctp-sapphire"
        >
          GitHub
        </a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
